{"unit_id":"ZhenXifu__dsh-collapsible-models#card-zh","repo":"ZhenXifu/dsh-collapsible-models","commit":"4fe7154f27c053c30ed9dffcad30de13e0391405","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-collapsible-models 是一个适用于 DSH 网页客户端的界面插件，为 composer 模型选择器替换原有模型选择座位，并沿用 DSH 的会话模型目录。用户可以展开或折叠各模型服务商分组，在分组中选择模型，并在模型提供推理等级时切换等级；菜单也显示加载状态、失败信息和重试入口。分组状态仅在当前选择器会话中保留。适合配置了多个模型服务商、希望缩短模型列表的 DSH 用户。使用需由 DSH 插件管理器安装，并依赖 DSH 已提供的模型选择器服务；无需额外密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/client.js:3-10","dsh/client.js:357-476","dsh/client.js:500-527"]}
{"unit_id":"ZhenXifu__dsh-collapsible-models#card-en","repo":"ZhenXifu/dsh-collapsible-models","commit":"4fe7154f27c053c30ed9dffcad30de13e0391405","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-collapsible-models replaces DSH's web composer model picker while reusing its session model directory. Collapse provider groups, choose models, and adjust offered reasoning levels. Loading errors have retry controls. It requires the host model-picker service and no extra key or account.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/client.js:3-10","dsh/client.js:357-476","dsh/client.js:500-527"]}
