{"unit_id":"ZhenXifu__dsh-collapsible-models#feature-1","repo":"ZhenXifu/dsh-collapsible-models","commit":"4fe7154f27c053c30ed9dffcad30de13e0391405","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-collapsible-models 的功能「折叠服务商分组」：在模型选择菜单中点击服务商标题即可隐藏或重新展开该组模型，组标题会显示展开状态。状态只保留在当前选择器会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/client.js:257-263","dsh/client.js:388-403"]}
{"unit_id":"ZhenXifu__dsh-collapsible-models#feature-2","repo":"ZhenXifu/dsh-collapsible-models","commit":"4fe7154f27c053c30ed9dffcad30de13e0391405","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-collapsible-models 的功能「选择模型」：打开模型选择器后，可浏览服务商分组并点击模型条目切换当前会话模型；条目展示模型名和可用描述。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/client.js:383-435"]}
{"unit_id":"ZhenXifu__dsh-collapsible-models#feature-3","repo":"ZhenXifu/dsh-collapsible-models","commit":"4fe7154f27c053c30ed9dffcad30de13e0391405","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-collapsible-models 的功能「调整推理等级」：模型提供推理等级时，用户可从菜单查看并选择等级；选择会提交给当前会话模型目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/client.js:151-163","dsh/client.js:337-356","dsh/client.js:442-476"]}
{"unit_id":"ZhenXifu__dsh-collapsible-models#feature-4","repo":"ZhenXifu/dsh-collapsible-models","commit":"4fe7154f27c053c30ed9dffcad30de13e0391405","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-collapsible-models 的功能「显示加载问题并重试」：目录加载中时显示状态，出现加载错误或服务商加载失败时显示说明和重试按钮，点击后重新加载目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/client.js:362-381"]}
